        "id": "p5-q4-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the midpoint $M$ of the interval $AB$ where the coordinates of $A$ are $(6,2)$ and the coordinates of $B$ are $(6,8)$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$M=(6,5)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x_M&=\\frac{6+6}{2}\\\\x_M&=6\\\\y_M&=\\frac{2+8}{2}\\\\y_M&=5\\end{align*}$$\nThe midpoint is $M=(6,5)$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q4-b",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Let $C$ be the point $(10,5)$. Find the distance between:",
        "layout": "grid",
        "columns": 2,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "p5-q4-b-i",
            "type": "part",
