              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}AB^2&=(6-6)^2+(8-2)^2\\\\AB^2&=0^2+6^2\\\\AB^2&=36\\\\AB&=6\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 30
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q4-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Describe triangle $ABC$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\triangle ABC$ is isosceles, with $AC=BC=5$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}BC^2&=(10-6)^2+(5-8)^2\\\\BC^2&=4^2+(-3)^2\\\\BC^2&=25\\\\BC&=5\\end{align*}$$\nSince $AC=BC=5$, triangle $ABC$ is isosceles.",
